                <head>Attachment</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">1. Proposed Birthday Greeting</hi></p>
                <p>It gives me great pleasure to extend greetings to Your Royal Highness on the
                    occasion of your birthday and to wish you many more years of good health and
                    happiness in the service of the people of Cambodia. I want to assure you of my
                    continuing regard for the leadership which you have given your country.</p>
            </div>
